{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23461","headline":"早饮湖州酒寄崔使君 · 白居易","name":"早饮湖州酒寄崔使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一榼扶头酒，泓澄泻玉壶。\n十分蘸甲酌，潋艳满银盂。\n捧出光华动，尝看气味殊。\n手中稀琥珀，舌上冷醍醐。\n瓶里有时尽，江边无处沽。\n不知崔太守，更有寄来无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}